reas range from 600x600mm up to 1500x3000mm, or fully customized to your production line, with laser power options of 30W, 50W, 100W, and 200W.", "Each custom fiber laser marking machine uses encoder-synced motion control to produce stitching-free large graphics, making it suited for continuous marking on long panels, conveyor-fed parts, or oversized components that a fixed-bed machine can not cover in a single pass. Pulse repetition rates of 2-500ns support fine detail even at large scale, and air cooling keeps the system running for extended production cycles.", "Whether you need a large-size fiber laser marking machine for oversized components or a fully custom working-area configuration for your specific line, Paratech Industries builds each system to spec and supports it with catalogue documentation and after-sales service across India."]', '[{"label": "Laser Type", "value": "Fiber Laser"}, {"label": "Laser Working Area", "value": "600x600 · 900x900 · 1200x1200 · 1300x2500 · 1500x3000 mm & Customize"}, {"label": "Laser Power", "value": "30, 50, 100, 200 W"}, {"label": "Pulse Repetition", "value": "2-500 ns"}, {"label": "Cooling", "value": "Air"}, {"label": "Continuous Marking", "value": "Encodersynced motion for stitchingfree large graphic"}]', '["flm1.png", "flm2.png", "flm3.png", "flm4.png", "flm5.png", "flm6.png"]', 'Customise Laser Machine', '2026-08-05 05:06:28.983098+00', 'fiber laser marking machine, UV laser marking machine, 30W Qr Code Laser Marking Machine', 'Customise Laser Marking Machine Manufacturer, Surat', 'Custom Fiber Laser Marking Machines with configurable working areas up to 1500x3000mm and power up to 200W. Built to spec by Paratech Industries.', '["Customise Laser Marking Machine","Custom Laser Marking Machine Manufacturer","Large Area Laser Marking Machine","Custom Working Area Fiber Laser","Paratech Industries Custom Laser Machine","Fiber Laser Marking Machine","Fiber Laser Marking Machine Manufacturer","Fiber Laser Marking Machine in S